{"id":"tor","lemma":"Tor","pos":"noun","rank":1150,"glosses":["gate, archway (passageway covered by an arch, particularly one made of masonry)","gate, door (large doorway, opening, or passage in a fence or wall)","gateway (point that represents the beginning of a transition from one place or phase to another)"],"ipa":"/toːr/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/c/c7/De-Tor.ogg/De-Tor.ogg.mp3","gender":"n","forms":{"genitive":"Tores","plural":"Tore"},"examples":[{"text":"Wo ist das Tor?","en":"Where is the gate?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/393466","words":[{"g":"where"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"the / that"},null]},{"text":"Ich warte vor dem Tore.","en":"I'll wait at the gate.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to wait","l":"warten"},{"g":"in front of, ahead of"},{"g":"(to) the","l":"der"},null]},{"text":"Schließt du bitte das Tor?","en":"Will you shut the gate, please?","words":[{"g":"to shut","l":"schließen"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"please"},{"g":"the / that"},null]},{"text":"Jemand steht vor dem Tor.","en":"Someone's standing in front of the gate.","words":[{"g":"someone, somebody"},{"g":"to stand","l":"stehen"},{"g":"in front of, ahead of"},{"g":"(to) the","l":"der"},null]},{"text":"Unsere Tore stehen offen.","en":"Our gates are open.","words":[{"g":"our","l":"unser"},null,{"g":"to stand"},{"g":"open"}]}]}